[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1131","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1131.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1488","title":"IBM Scalable POWERparallel SP2 sdrd 远程文件读取漏洞","description":"IBM Scalable POWERparallel (SP) 2.0 系统的系统数据仓库（SDR）中的 sdrd 守护进程存在未授权文件读取漏洞。远程攻击者无需任何身份认证即可利用 sdrd 服务的权限缺陷，通过向目标发送特制请求读取系统上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 IBM SP2 2.0 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等，已在后续版本中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1488"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:32Z","remediation":"升级 IBM SP2 系统软件至不受影响的版本，在 IBM 发布官方补丁前，可在 /etc/hosts.allow 和 /etc/hosts.deny 中限制 sdrd 服务的访问来源，仅允许可信管理节点连接。如无需远程 SDR 访问功能，可在 inetd.conf 中注释 sdrd 服务行并重启 inetd 以彻底禁用该守护进程。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/i-079a.shtml","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7217.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/371","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19297","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b4109a5f204e995e8b4c403f2d8e63073bf1f4d9/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1488.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1488","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1488.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ed836d32ec0f7204df361b2aedfef822b3e814e/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1488.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fe37e86b4ab6d44c1acc95d76e30f97043bfd67f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pjw4-g8gx-f3vw/GHSA-pjw4-g8gx-f3vw.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1488.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001057.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--bf75d5a4-a29d-4870-8c70-82759ed4d7ed.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1131.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1128","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1128.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1481","title":"Squid Web Proxy 身份验证绕过漏洞","description":"Squid 网络代理缓存软件在使用外部认证模块时，由于对用户输入的用户名/密码对中的换行符过滤不严，远程攻击者可通过在认证凭据中插入换行符绕过访问控制规则，获取未授权资源访问权限。该漏洞影响 Squid 2.2.STABLE5 及更早版本，危害等级中危，CVSS 评分 5.0。建议用户升级至更新版本或启用严格输入过滤措施。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1481"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:32Z","remediation":"升级至 Squid 2.3 或更新版本即可修复此漏洞；如无法升级，可下载应用官方补丁 squid-2.2.stable5-newlines_in_auth.patch，在 decode 外部认证的用户名/密码后增加换行符过滤逻辑，防止换行符绕过访问控制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/33295","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/741","http://www.squid-cache.org/Versions/v2/2.2/bugs/","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3433","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19567","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/559e7878a2bcd153513c59154e730dfe23ee3b94/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1481.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1481","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1481.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ed836d32ec0f7204df361b2aedfef822b3e814e/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1481.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fe37e86b4ab6d44c1acc95d76e30f97043bfd67f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fx2h-93c2-339q/GHSA-fx2h-93c2-339q.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--fae97c09-d960-49db-879c-a19db82392f0.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1481.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1128.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1128.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1128.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1125","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1125.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1476","title":"Intel Pentium 处理器拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Intel Pentium 处理器（MMX 和 Overdrive 型号）存在指令处理缺陷，本地攻击者可通过执行一条特定的非法指令（锁定 CMPXCHG8B 指令的无效操作数）触发处理器异常，导致基于 Intel 架构的操作系统（如 Windows NT 和 Windows 95）挂起崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞需本地用户权限才能利用，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1476"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:31Z","remediation":"Intel 发布了处理器微码更新修复此问题，操作系统层面需安装 Windows NT/95 相应安全补丁。临时缓解措施：避免在受影响 Pentium 处理器上执行包含 LOCK 前缀的 CMPXCHG8B 指令，或通过操作系统内核补丁捕获该异常防止系统挂起。该漏洞仅影响早期 Pentium MMX/Overdrive 处理器，升级至后续 P6 架构处理器即可完全规避。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/q163/8/52.asp","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/704","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d0edc539747872cdfd58847b81673ec0de903cd8/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1476.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1476","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1476.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e55eacb4f05da66af6c788dc1e36dafe4a12a8f8/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1476.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/17e1f7e717645251fb6b373e30015c6747bedf2c/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9chc-c4xr-3frx/GHSA-9chc-c4xr-3frx.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x85000/84449/info.html","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-833.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1476.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001055.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1125.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1123","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1123.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1473","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 页面重定向认证信息泄露漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 3.02 及 4.0 版本存在页面重定向认证信息泄露漏洞。当用户访问恶意网站时，攻击者可通过 HTTP 重定向将浏览器跳转至第三方站点，IE 会自动将原始站点的身份认证信息（如 NTLM 凭据）发送给重定向目标服务器，导致用户敏感认证数据被窃取。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞，影响运行 IE 3.02 和 4.0 的 Windows 系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1473"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:31Z","remediation":"升级至 Internet Explorer 5.0 及以上版本即可修复该页面重定向认证泄露问题。当前建议使用 Edge 或 Chrome 等现代浏览器替代已停止支持的旧版 IE，彻底消除此类安全隐患。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/q176/6/97.asp","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7426.php","http://www.osvdb.org/7818","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d0edc539747872cdfd58847b81673ec0de903cd8/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1473.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1473","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1473.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e55eacb4f05da66af6c788dc1e36dafe4a12a8f8/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1473.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/6adb77879df86f875473cd5dc5a48fc3b9483823/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rc82-f234-qr88/GHSA-rc82-f234-qr88.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1473.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001053.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--87310f6c-e3e3-44bc-9d56-f665a8c48b4b.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87907/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1123.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1122","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1122.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1472","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 4.0 存在同源策略绕过导致的信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可在恶意网页中嵌入极小的 IFRAME 框架，利用 Dynamic HTML（DHTML）技术读取受害者本机上的任意文本及 HTML 文件内容，并将窃取的数据发送至攻击者控制的远程服务器。该漏洞无需任何身份认证，攻击者仅需诱导用户访问恶意网页即可触发，属于中等危害等级的信息泄露漏洞，影响 Internet Explorer 4.0 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1472"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:30Z","remediation":"升级 Internet Explorer 至 5.0 或更高版本（该漏洞在 IE 5.0 中已修复）。IE 4.0 已于 2001 年停止支持，建议迁移至 Microsoft Edge 或其他现代浏览器以持续获取安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87710897923098&w=2","http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/q176/6/97.asp","http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/q176/7/94.asp","http://www.insecure.org/sploits/Internet_explorer_4.0.hack.html","http://www.microsoft.com/Windows/ie/security/freiburg.asp","http://www.osvdb.org/7819","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/587","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d0edc539747872cdfd58847b81673ec0de903cd8/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1472.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1472","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1472.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e55eacb4f05da66af6c788dc1e36dafe4a12a8f8/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1472.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c0ecee517847401d3373d71885a21da53715a840/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-86r9-xq76-hv9m/GHSA-86r9-xq76-hv9m.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001052.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--1419c91d-3291-4908-865f-a19061292bfe.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1472.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/5721d007794215ff21176b4cb4c7f370781f5dd1/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1122.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1122.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1122.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1119","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1119.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1465","title":"Cisco IOS 分布式快速交换访问控制列表安全绕过漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 11.1 至 11.3 版本在启用分布式快速交换（DFS）功能时存在访问控制列表绕过漏洞。当路由器将流量从启用了 DFS 的输入接口转发至具有逻辑子接口的输出接口时，远程攻击者可利用该缺陷绕过 ACL 规则，导致未授权网络访问。该漏洞影响大量 Cisco 路由器设备，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Cisco 已发布相关修复建议。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1465"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:29Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS 至 11.3(6) 或更高版本以修复此漏洞，或禁用分布式快速交换（DFS）功能：在接口配置模式下执行 `no ip route-cache distributed`。无法升级时，避免在 DFS 启用接口和逻辑子接口间路由流量以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/j-016.shtml","http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/770/iosdfsacl-pub.shtml","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1401","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/1999/CVE-1999-1465.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5102a7cca13b4c0a0e55e628783c406707da47e/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1465.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1465","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e55eacb4f05da66af6c788dc1e36dafe4a12a8f8/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1465.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1465.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/78550cb05ca9623089e78169330acf979f4b64ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x374-xvgw-jpfc/GHSA-x374-xvgw-jpfc.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1465.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4f3adf37-aab5-42e0-8863-8ff325d0b00d.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/C/cisco-sa-19981105-ios-dfs-aclhttp.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1119.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1118","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1118.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1464","title":"Cisco IOS 分布式快速交换访问控制列表绕过漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 11.1CC 和 11.1CT 版本中分布式快速交换（DFS）功能存在安全绕过漏洞。当路由器将流量从启用了 DFS 的接口转发到未启用 DFS 的接口时，远程攻击者可通过发送特制数据包绕过特定访问控制列表（ACL）的过滤规则，导致未授权网络访问。该漏洞影响 Cisco IOS 11.1CC 和 11.1CT 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1464"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:29Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS 至 11.1CC 或 11.1CT 之后的安全修复版本（如 12.0 及以上）；如无法升级，请在接口上禁用分布式快速交换（DFS，使用 `no ip route-cache distributed` 命令），或改用快速交换/进程交换模式以避免 ACL 绕过。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/j-016.shtml","http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/770/iosdfsacl-pub.shtml","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1401","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/1999/CVE-1999-1464.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV