sh 的访问。同时确保 CGI 脚本对文件路径参数做严格的白名单校验，禁止包含 ../ 等目录遍历字符。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bb4.com/README.CHANGES","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/13440","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/142","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3755","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5102a7cca13b4c0a0e55e628783c406707da47e/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1462.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1462","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1462.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2cba6a622b2958fa1ec3a506e7b58871edec19fb/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1462.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/bb-hist.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/78550cb05ca9623089e78169330acf979f4b64ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fwqm-q5x9-cvjv/GHSA-fwqm-q5x9-cvjv.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/142/info.html","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--0be18609-ef23-4332-9f03-c94852851693.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1117.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1114","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1114.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1456","title":"ACME thttpd HTTP Server 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"thttpd HTTP Server 2.03 及更早版本存在路径遍历漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标服务器发送包含多个连续前导斜杠（/）的 GET 请求，绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件，如配置文件或系统敏感信息。该漏洞源于服务器对 URI 中斜杠字符的过滤不严，导致路径回溯检查失效，影响范围较广。用户应升级至 thttpd 2.04 或更高版本修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1456"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:28Z","remediation":"升级 thttpd 至 2.04 或更高版本（该版本限制路径中不能包含连续前导斜杠）。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器前部署反向代理（如 Nginx），在代理层过滤含多个连续斜杠的 GET 请求；或在 thttpd 源码 `libhttpd.c` 中 `httpd_parse_request()` 函数增加对连续前导斜杠的拒绝逻辑后重新编译。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.acme.com/software/thttpd/thttpd.html#releasenotes","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/10368","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1809","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4035b63c9f7b02a7407eb5dd431d3b6ffb26cebc/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1456.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1456","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1456.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2cba6a622b2958fa1ec3a506e7b58871edec19fb/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1456.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/de3f834577328e71a123358d1db2b1637bc19e8a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j7q2-439r-63fw/GHSA-j7q2-439r-63fw.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/thttpd_bug.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87939/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1456.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-41.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1114.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1114.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1114.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1113","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1113.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1455","title":"Microsoft Windows NT RSH 访问控制漏洞","description":"Windows NT 系统中的 RSH 服务（RSHSVC）存在访问控制漏洞。当用户从 .Rhosts 文件配置的授权主机发起连接时，服务未能正确校验文件中的访问限制规则，导致未经授权的攻击者可通过从受信任主机登录的方式绕过身份认证机制，非法访问 RSH 服务。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 3.5 至 4.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者需要具备受信任主机的访问权限方可实施利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1455"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:28Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Windows Server 2003 及以上受支持版本，RSH 服务 (RSHSVC) 已在后续版本中移除。如无法升级，在 Windows NT 4.0 中通过服务管理器 (services.exe) 停止 RSH 服务并将启动类型设为\"禁用\"，同时在防火墙策略中阻止 TCP 514 端口入站连接以彻底阻断攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/q158/3/20.asp","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7422","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4035b63c9f7b02a7407eb5dd431d3b6ffb26cebc/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1455.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1455","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1455.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2cba6a622b2958fa1ec3a506e7b58871edec19fb/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1455.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/de3f834577328e71a123358d1db2b1637bc19e8a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-63g3-6533-36p6/GHSA-63g3-6533-36p6.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87958/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1455.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/3ff80c5b3b825d7f48ed77b5e27dd49f02502867/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1113.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1110","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1110.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1452","title":"Microsoft Windows NT GINA 权限许可和访问控制漏洞","description":"Windows NT 4.0 的 GINA（图形化标识和身份验证）组件存在权限许可和访问控制漏洞。当用户锁定工作站后，系统未正确清空剪贴板内容，导致具有物理访问权限的攻击者可通过在用户名输入框中执行粘贴操作（CTRL-V），从而获取已锁定用户剪贴板中的部分敏感信息。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，但需要物理接触目标系统，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1452"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:28Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Windows NT 4.0 Service Pack 6a (SP6a)，该版本已包含此漏洞的修复。如无法升级，可应用 Microsoft 知识库文章 Q214802 提供的专用热修复补丁。由于 Windows NT 4.0 已终止支持，强烈建议升级至受支持的 Windows Server 版本。临时缓解措施：用户在锁定工作站前手动清空剪贴板（复制任意无关内容覆盖当前剪贴板数据），以防止锁屏状态下剪贴板信息被窃取。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=91788829326419&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=91764169410814&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=91822011021558&w=2","http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/q214/8/02.asp","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/198","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1975","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4035b63c9f7b02a7407eb5dd431d3b6ffb26cebc/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1452.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1452","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1452.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9849013fb49e540f15cffd30644fcdcb875c1d4f/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1452.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/de3f834577328e71a123358d1db2b1637bc19e8a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vp3g-7p5g-pfq8/GHSA-vp3g-7p5g-pfq8.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001046.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--dfd60340-bb6d-4709-a591-ab62c2e86af4.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1452.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1110.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1107","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1107.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1451","title":"Microsoft IIS 及 Site Server Winmsdp.exe 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"IIS 4.0 及 Site Server 3.0 中的 Winmsdp.exe 示例文件存在任意文件读取漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向该示例文件发送特制请求，利用路径遍历方式读取服务器上的任意文件，导致数据库连接信息、源代码等敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Microsoft IIS 4.0 和 Site Server 3.0 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，建议禁用或删除该示例文件进行修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1451"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:28Z","remediation":"立即应用 Microsoft 安全公告 MS99-013 提供的补丁（KB231368），下载地址见于公告页面；同时删除 IIS 4.0 或 Site Server 3.0 服务器上 /iissamples/ 目录下的 Winmsdp.exe 文件，并在生产环境中移除整个示例文件目录（/iissamples/）以避免类似组件被利用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/q231/3/68.asp","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-013","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3271","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4035b63c9f7b02a7407eb5dd431d3b6ffb26cebc/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1451.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1451","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1451.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9849013fb49e540f15cffd30644fcdcb875c1d4f/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1451.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/de3f834577328e71a123358d1db2b1637bc19e8a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f34c-2f6w-9c2v/GHSA-f34c-2f6w-9c2v.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/invicti/vulnerabilities/db/vulnerabilities/vdb/1999/1xxx/cve-1999-1451.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1451.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/InfoSecWarrior/Vulnerable-Box-Resources/blob/c784bcf63e1ec5c3a0116043d8653d00f0a21a0b/Vulnhub/OZ/oz-1-nikto-8080-output.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87969/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1107.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1105","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1105.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1444","title":"Alibaba 2.0 genkey RSA 密钥生成弱密钥漏洞","description":"阿里巴巴 2.0 中的 genkey 密钥生成工具存在 RSA 密钥对生成缺陷，其使用指数 1 生成 RSA 密钥对。由于 RSA 算法中指数为 1 时加密等同于明文传输，导致所有使用该工具生成的密钥进行的交易数据实际上以明文形式在网络中传输，攻击者可通过网络嗅探直接获取敏感交易信息。该漏洞影响阿里巴巴 2.0 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1444"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:27Z","remediation":"升级 Alibaba 至 2.0 以上版本，确保 genkey 使用正确的 RSA 公钥指数（如 65537）而非指数 1。无法升级时应立即替换自行生成的 RSA 密钥对，并停止使用 genkey 工具生成加密密钥，改用 OpenSSL 等标准工具生成密钥对。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://catless.ncl.ac.uk/Risks/20.41.html#subj4","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cc228e85e595b2c95bda5544193864b06177c050/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1444.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1444","https://github.com/C2SP/wycheproof/blob/fc24cd5b787d8e496bff31b0468af693a652b0f2/doc/bib.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1444.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9849013fb49e540f15cffd30644fcdcb875c1d4f/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1444.json","https://github.com/huahua132/skynet_fly/blob/8d09dfdbf29612dbcc6b3acdcbede80434add9ef/3rd/openssl/wycheproof/doc/rsa.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/de3f834577328e71a123358d1db2b1637bc19e8a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-frc4-j6xj-vg8w/GHSA-frc4-j6xj-vg8w.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1444.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001044.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--600b6cd9-97c9-4150-9f4a-b4a83d5d1e48.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1105.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1094","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1094.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1382","title":"NetWare NFS 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"NetWare NFS 在 mode 1 和 mode 2 中实现 Unix 文件“只读”标志时存在权限许可漏洞。当用户将文件标记为“只读”时，系统会将文件所有者改为 root。本地攻击者可利用此机制，先创建一个 setuid 程序，然后将其设置为“只读”，NetWare NFS 便会将该程序转换为 root 所有的 setuid 程序，从而使攻击者获得 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Unix 平台上的 NetWare NFS 服务，攻击者需要本地访问权限，利用难度较低，危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1382"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:19Z","remediation":"升级到不再使用将 \"Read Only\" 标记转换为 root 所有权的 NFS 模式的 NetWare 版本，或禁用 mode 1/2 的 NFS 导出；在受影响系统上限制本地用户对 setuid 文件的创建权限，监控并审计异常的文件所有权变更。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=88427711321769&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90295697702474&w=2","http://support.novell.com/cgi-bin/search/tidfinder.cgi?2940551","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7246.php","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0b8e5ca8c68c148c2498e70421f33344e9cff1e8/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1382.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1382","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1382.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/929f101fd7b4d4314a4b92f62a8cc2523c6d76f0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1382.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/491d1a908ffff7b174e17aaac4d0207c13405fa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c5ww-jjpp-2wr5/GHSA-c5ww-jjpp-2wr5.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1382.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5f7427b4-f5cd-4f07-8678-5fed6ed1f04c.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1094.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1093","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1093.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1379","title":"DNS 服务器 UDP 反射放大拒绝服务漏洞","description":"DNS协议存在反射放大攻击漏洞，远程攻击者通过向开放的DNS递归服务器发送源地址伪造的UDP查询请求，使响应数据包远大于请求包，从而将大量流量反射至受害者目标，造成带宽耗尽型拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有未限制递归查询的DNS服务器，攻击者无需认证即可利用，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1379"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:18Z","remediation":"在 DNS 服务器上禁用递归查询（仅开放给可信客户端），部署响应速率限制（Response Rate Limiting, RRL），配置 BCP38 源地址验证过滤伪造 IP 的流量，升级 BIND 至 9.18 或更高版本以支持内置的防放大攻击保护。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/j-063.shtml","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93348057829957&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93433758607623&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7238.php","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/36911ad057245f7d02822794db0f459d9b4c9b8f/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1379.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1379","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1379.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3012e